WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.243 --> 00:00:02.202
♫ I'm gonna eat some worms

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.828
♫ Long and skinny ones,

00:00:03.828 --> 00:00:05.080
♫ Big, thick fat ones,

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.582
♫ I'm gonna eat some worms ♫

00:00:07.582 --> 00:00:08.625
- This isn't a real song.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:09.748
- It's a real song!

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:11.420
- Timon and Pumbaa used to eat bugs,

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.504
and they turned out great.

00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:14.589
- Everyone's had a bug
fly in their mouth before,

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:15.758
so this is no different.

00:00:15.758 --> 00:00:20.346
- Ohh no!
- Ha ha ha!

00:00:20.346 --> 00:00:22.806
- Just think of of it
as like it's popcorn.

00:00:22.806 --> 00:00:23.665
- It's popcorn.

00:00:23.665 --> 00:00:25.309
- It's popcorn, it's popcorn.

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:26.913
- Hakuna matata.

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:31.898
(laughs)

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.483
- The aftertaste is like a pistachio,

00:00:33.483 --> 00:00:35.235
but like, I don't know,
that was a bad one.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.529
- Oh, the head came off.

00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:39.072
- I could see myself like drunk,

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.407
just eating this whole thing.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.792
- It sounds like pretzel sticks.

00:00:45.036 --> 00:00:46.163
- This looks like something

00:00:46.163 --> 00:00:48.034
that will give you a tapeworm.

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:50.500
- Don't lick it.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.543
What are you doing, Keith?

00:00:51.543 --> 00:00:53.128
- Oh, don't lick the bug.

00:00:53.128 --> 00:00:55.380
That's not the right way to eat the bug.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.165
- For all we know, that could be

00:00:56.165 --> 00:00:57.299
peanut butter on the inside.

00:00:57.299 --> 00:00:59.976
- Arrrrgh!

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:01.553
- I dig this.

00:01:01.553 --> 00:01:03.013
- It tastes like, a little
bit like a snap pea.

00:01:03.013 --> 00:01:06.100
- I like it, but if it was, like, gummy

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.809
and like not an actual worm,

00:01:07.809 --> 00:01:09.144
but it was just like a gummy version

00:01:09.144 --> 00:01:10.812
and it was sour and it
had different colors,

00:01:10.812 --> 00:01:12.022
I think I would love it then.

00:01:12.022 --> 00:01:13.900
- I would much rather have
a plate of dead grasshoppers

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.776
than a plate of live grasshoppers.

00:01:15.776 --> 00:01:17.652
That's for damn sure.

00:01:17.652 --> 00:01:19.946
- Imagine if you just
saw that jump at you,

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:20.643
like...

00:01:20.643 --> 00:01:21.638
- Hey!

00:01:21.638 --> 00:01:23.420
- Oh my God!

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:25.243
(helicopter sound)

00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:26.279
- Do it!

00:01:29.587 --> 00:01:32.106
- Mm, pretty crunchy.

00:01:32.106 --> 00:01:34.795
- This also tastes like going to the vet.

00:01:34.795 --> 00:01:37.923
It tastes like that stainless
steel, animal sadness.

00:01:37.923 --> 00:01:39.039
- Not bad.

00:01:40.577 --> 00:01:42.204
- Bring it on over, what you got?

00:01:42.204 --> 00:01:43.387
- [Voiceover] Scorpions!

00:01:43.387 --> 00:01:45.263
- [Voiceover] Scorpions, scorpions.

00:01:45.263 --> 00:01:47.224
- Yo, isn't this how Steve Irwin died?

00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:48.266
- Look at this little guy.

00:01:48.266 --> 00:01:49.459
This guy will hurt you.

00:01:49.459 --> 00:01:50.868
- I don't know, oh, okay.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.729
- You gotta eat the stinger.

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:53.855
- Yeah.

00:01:55.716 --> 00:01:57.484
- Oh, it's so hard to eat.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:58.652
- Mmm!

00:01:58.652 --> 00:02:02.067
- Oh my God, wow, woah!

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:04.012
- Woah, this is great!

00:02:04.012 --> 00:02:05.992
- Oh, ooh! I like it!

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.118
So salty.

00:02:07.118 --> 00:02:08.119
This one's amazing.

00:02:08.119 --> 00:02:09.120
- Mmm, It's good!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.122
It's so good!
- It's so good!

00:02:10.122 --> 00:02:13.250
- It tasted like old sweat, right?

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.709
- Scorpion king! You can call me.

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:17.420
(laughter)

00:02:18.943 --> 00:02:20.423
- I legitimately believe, in the future,

00:02:20.423 --> 00:02:22.301
we're gonna have to eat bugs, so...

00:02:22.301 --> 00:02:25.095
- I will do it then, like
then my tolerance will be

00:02:25.095 --> 00:02:27.055
like, I must survive.

00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:29.182
But right now I know we got some Cheetos.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.433
- I mean, I guess at the end of the day,

00:02:30.433 --> 00:02:32.936
what's weirder, eating insect larvae

00:02:32.936 --> 00:02:36.249
or mushing together different chicken bits

00:02:36.249 --> 00:02:38.615
into dinosaur shapes?

00:02:40.599 --> 00:02:41.854
- That's a good point.

00:02:44.346 --> 00:02:45.866
- [Woman] Oh my God!

00:02:45.866 --> 00:02:48.408
- [Man] Why did you make me do that?

